### TinderBot REST
### Environment: local (см. requests/http-client.env.json)
### 1) Выберите environment "local" в выпадающем списке HTTP Client
### 2) Сначала выполните "JWT login" — токен сохранится в {{jwt}}

### --- JWT login ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("jwt", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### --- Sessions ---
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{chatId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### --- PATCH mode ---
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{chatId}}/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "GPT"
}

### --- PROFILE questionnaire ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{chatId}}/questionnaires/PROFILE/start
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### --- GPT message ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{chatId}}/gpt/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Как начать разговор на свидании?"
}

### --- DATE message (first message needs starKey) ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{chatId}}/date/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Привет! Как насчёт кофе?",
  "starKey": "date_grande"
}

### --- DATE follow-up ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{chatId}}/date/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Расскажи о себе"
}

### --- Message history + next ---
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{chatId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Привет, как дела?"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{chatId}}/messages/next
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
